#: scenario:scenario_4658E743_4327_4AE0_A0D6_F4ED2C05ED7A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 41256b8f6a6e234548c0110a539aa9287241859cfa9a816e1fc415560fc55412
#. default-sha256: 94549730c3e198d2467d6e3bb8444059050a72c5147dbb40045627eb34e7d29d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4658E743_4327_4AE0_A0D6_F4ED2C05ED7A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My transgression is that I was unable to completely predict where this path we were "
"traveling led."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……そう、⟪k:1⟫未来の顛末を予測できなかった罪でございます。"

#: scenario:scenario_F421FEF6_8212_4F76_902F_126E652CBBA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 43a2264388ad89bf914a9b703cb87ed5b5870f611886f39162c4ee19fce1a8ad
#. default-sha256: 11877315923387f1b7dd083ff47763928155ef2b66b549be03e198e1972346a5
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F421FEF6_8212_4F76_902F_126E652CBBA2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My hands were full dealing with my immediate day-to-day tasks, ⟪k:1⟫so I could do naught but "
"pray there was happiness waiting in the future."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫わたくし、⟪k:1⟫この時は目先のことで手一杯でございましたから、⟪k:2⟫どうにか幸福が訪れてほしい"
"と願っておりましたの。"

#: scenario:scenario_04CA1AB7_ED67_44C2_99D6_240B21119DA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd9b8facd0ee9af93cd1f7c9cacb58bf26c68eea9422e86429588d9f85b12469
#. default-sha256: 7a981dea3bfdb96118b6c446ba8223d4bc31e58164963beee35d22ca97327c84
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_04CA1AB7_ED67_44C2_99D6_240B21119DA2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Happiness for everyone who lived within Rose Manor."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫薔薇の館に住まう人々、⟪k:1⟫全てにとっての幸福ですわ。"

#: scenario:scenario_74D191F3_BB97_4584_A235_BF0E0F8B6ADA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 57e24e65b4bf1330056ca3b27f2cf6d20ffbcc53a457ddcde6cd78163c3b4083
#. default-sha256: 61d7bf54794006f0a3dddadfe657d1649d757e66686b48f1dd6bd101614fbdbe
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_74D191F3_BB97_4584_A235_BF0E0F8B6ADA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I am but a mere maid. ⟪k:1⟫There are limits to what I am allowed to do. ⟪k:2⟫And "
"furthermore, it was not my place to offer her my hand."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫けれどわたくしは、⟪k:1⟫館の女中。⟪k:2⟫出過ぎた真似は出来ません。⟪k:3⟫それに……彼女の手を取るの"
"も、⟪k:4⟫わたくしの役目ではありませんから。"

#: scenario:scenario_AAA2349C_6637_4436_A69F_0E7A3C2D9015
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e2f2546d1e07040e533d304991ad1544b7fc80f825d1adf7c011cb17419999bb
