msgctxt "scenario:scenario_AAA2349C_6637_4436_A69F_0E7A3C2D9015"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Roads, such as the one we were following, have a way of diverging with little warning."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫わたくしは、⟪k:1⟫事態が急激に流れていくのを、⟪k:2⟫理解していました。"

#: scenario:scenario_887020DA_B005_43BF_A41A_0E9FBBA7E143
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b0803627078ae73364879e4a22f6e4621e01a530919c86286bf744e182c8a1c8
