#: scenario:scenario_5E3FFC92_40C2_4D6A_B331_110CB044A00F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6af3e4d4878fb6ccefd24ef7bb7b4ace3118010987665ba4e69e838ebb7c7be9
