#: scenario:scenario_4C79A825_BC8B_4501_A0B5_2BA0E88A8755
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e6fd33610414c82da0966d47c02b66a1ced3bca276287f85a45820d37c868f9b
