msgctxt "scenario:scenario_6962A1BA_5A83_4624_A0CC_8C6E364D191B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My father’s paintings were no less skillful!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫His was a talent that could not be "
"easily imitated!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫父の作品だって素晴らしかったんです！⟪k:1⟫　あの人の技術は容易く真似出来るものじゃない……！"

#: scenario:scenario_915E5451_8083_472C_8693_C47ACEFE7ED5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 217a3bf44f79c0929c48f79d2e5d9e261c5b1d7382856f4cd478263af6006f55
#. default-sha256: 9f5f9243fc25e9932ec5df9844f6e03e6d4d90aee7f33f696082fddb4120397f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_915E5451_8083_472C_8693_C47ACEFE7ED5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But no one was willing to separate the art from the artist."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫でも、⟪k:1⟫誰も、⟪k:2⟫作品だけを見てくれないんです……。"

#: scenario:scenario_21810620_3685_4F78_9BCA_832550E29B62
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f91585eb1260d7128d78724945a1a34b06939453f93a577ec8167b074b3a47b6
