msgstr "⟪k:0⟫………、⟪k:1⟫………………。"

#: scenario:scenario_28853A73_29D4_4A43_BF93_9BA4F07EF93B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c67fc605a2846e06989ddbc287999fb3ae3545e7c303928c9b09bedae3cd03d1
#. default-sha256: 1ae9955ef38abce0a03d296fde364dfb14ce7e838d8b5390b9c1b9f6c678ed63
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_28853A73_29D4_4A43_BF93_9BA4F07EF93B"
