"⟪k:0⟫I disdained the Rhodes family for putting us...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫no, for putting my father through "
"such hardship."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……私はローズ家を恨みました。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫私達を……いいえ、⟪k:3⟫父をここまで追い詰めたあなた方"
"を……。"

#: scenario:scenario_472740DE_ED88_4671_9470_93460F18559C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0af7bd385764f1c6d76b094e832a376c043b7632860cf96232db10e19cf0bb21
#. default-sha256: 527bc4d6142ebb4abbcb448a4af083c8fe51cf81dfde1c27e7fa08db61163a71
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_472740DE_ED88_4671_9470_93460F18559C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I imagined you were still living in decadence,⟪k:1⟫acting as though nothing had ever "
"happened."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫あなた方は、⟪k:1⟫変わらずに幸福な暮らしを送っているんでしょう。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫過去のことなど何一つ"
"無かったことにして。"

#: scenario:scenario_2E8B6A2C_E63A_40F1_AC64_11E4AF5DCA1C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 71a26d36ece7854e995506ef31903f3d84fb1afd68f1a6626e89ef3321a24522
#. default-sha256: 21b736c7c137b430634431e144a8de10c3d92e0707f5720e1adcaf28b040c34f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2E8B6A2C_E63A_40F1_AC64_11E4AF5DCA1C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No, ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫you wouldn’t even care about the fate of one simple painter.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Our "
"lives meant nothing to you..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫いいえ――⟪k:1⟫一人の絵描きの顛末など、⟪k:2⟫どうでもいいことなんです。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫私達の人生なん"
"て、⟪k:5⟫結局は……。"

#: scenario:scenario_069495CE_C027_4774_A7EF_20A347FC2145
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bcb4edd0122d2ba9b1831a1cb653202252cf510d43604fde409a70fa8e00c8f9
#. default-sha256: 7b6f78bf1c63b915d8de65ad1dd89b6ab2b15c78e80edec3516a8be7772b70a7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_069495CE_C027_4774_A7EF_20A347FC2145"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And so, I sought to bring misfortune upon you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫だから私は、⟪k:1⟫あなた達を……不幸に落としてやりたかったんです……。"

#: scenario:scenario_480EC6D3_51C4_47F4_8798_38493C5712CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6566c75db02e5cc6eb5c549ebc08d8b677b645ede00c734c3b724f09fba8b610
