msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3FC565AD_D74E_4DD5_9DB3_30143B74377F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In truth, I had wanted to take the master’s life,⟪k:1⟫but your father spends so much time "
"outside the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……本当は、⟪k:1⟫お館様を……手にかけてしまいたかったんです。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫でも、⟪k:4⟫あなたのお父様"
"はよくご実家に戻られるでしょう。"

#: scenario:scenario_F4ADF25F_1C0F_4AEB_B771_C5CE544279C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ef82ff4591bb44ae761b6be36adfabf295f87599da65dd876bb37d3df9963af
