msgctxt "scenario:scenario_96ADFF43_9B89_4340_804B_D4BE556E5EBB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But on the night of the storm,⟪k:1⟫the mistress was the first one to extend her hand to me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫でも、⟪k:1⟫嵐の夜、⟪k:2⟫屋敷に訪れた私を……まず、⟪k:3⟫奥様が優しくして下さいました。"

#: scenario:scenario_7B76CFE3_409A_4B9A_814F_084FD1A08324
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
