msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I arrived at the mansion disguised as a beggar—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Actually, “disguised” is not the "
"right word, as many nights I only survived on the generosity of others."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫私は物乞いの振りをして――⟪k:1⟫いいえ、⟪k:2⟫実際半分はそうやって生きていましたけど、⟪k:3⟫情けを"
"乞う振りをして屋敷に訪れたんです。"

#: scenario:scenario_65863436_D2F5_43EB_8207_B6C7C3C0924A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0361c500e1c895db794a3e826cf2293f469949bb3970cb69fc9704d314822b5b
