msgctxt "scenario:scenario_65863436_D2F5_43EB_8207_B6C7C3C0924A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The mistress did not send me away when she saw me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Quite the opposite—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫she "
"took me in as a servant."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫現れた奥様は、⟪k:1⟫私を単に帰しはしませんでした。⟪k:2⟫それどころか……侍女として屋敷に置いて下"
"さるとまで……。"

#: scenario:scenario_8B3C936B_1D1B_4E2F_AD9A_79A6C8A2D79E
