msgid "⟪k:0⟫So that was Mother’s doing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……その提案をしたのは、⟪k:1⟫母様だったのか。"

#: scenario:scenario_EA4815B8_4D8D_4CD4_93DE_13CDC1833F85
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7aedf784e2ff622546fb907b8a3c099aa0c3547ee4b80c3b264599ed97863009
